        "TileImage": "$($repository 2697b700-363c-43f7-af81-ae91c0373fbf).Image",
        "Description": "Evening, 47.\r\rAs you know, the ICA is neutral. Always has been. However, we have been contacted by the Moreno Cartel to eliminate Andrea Martinez, one of three figureheads leading the Delgado Drug Cartel. Andrea is visiting the heart of France and is exchanging the crucial flight plans of South American President,  Juan Orlando Hernandez, with Dalia Margolis.\rWe&apos;ve had our eyes on them for a long time. When one falls, the rest follow.\r\rI&apos;ll leave you time to prepare. Good luck.",
